  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "每名Commander都是带随机特质的克隆体，鹰眼潜行者、吸血忍者等组合会产生不同机制与协同",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Clone your every Commander with randomly selected traits. Can you lead your squad to victory with a hawk-eyed, sly Infiltrator? Or battle solo as a nocturnal, greedy One-Man Army? How about a brilliant, vampiric Ninja? Each combination of traits yields a unique run with its own set of challenges, mechanics, and surprising synergies.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2141520/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "从专属武器与战术各异的Merc中组队，再为克隆援军选择专精树并用高科技Gear强化",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Assemble your mercenary team from a roster of vigorous fighters. Each Merc totes their own arsenal and personal tactics to tackle the robot horde. Call in your Merc clone reinforcements, pick their optimal specialization tree for your operation, and supercharge their combat effectiveness with hi-tech Gear to build a game-breaking, horde-slaying killer squad.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2141520/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "战场每过一分钟敌人都会变多变强，抵达撤离点后还要坚守；死亡丢掉战利品，存活才能带回基地",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "The clock is ticking - each minute on the battlefield means more, stronger enemies. Get to the extraction point and defend it until your choppa takes you to the next stage! Fight and survive long enough to face the unique, massive bosses and their underlings. But beware: it's all or nothing! Die, and lose your loot. Survive, and take home your spoils of war to come back even stronger!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2141520/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
